libraw-codecs — camera-raw decoders ported from LibRaw
=====================================================

The C/C++ sources in this repository are ports of decoders from LibRaw
(https://github.com/LibRaw/LibRaw). LibRaw is licensed under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or
the CDDL 1.0, at the recipient's option. These ports are distributed under the
Common Development and Distribution License, version 1.0 (see LICENSE).

They are compiled to WebAssembly and loaded at runtime by a separate application,
which combines them into a Larger Work (CDDL-1.0 section 3.6). That application is
not part of this repository and is not covered by this license; this repository
provides the Source Code form required by CDDL-1.0 section 3.1.

